h3><font color=\"#1B5E20\">✍️ 문제 7-3 · 시만 꺼내기</font></h3></td></tr></table>\n","\n","`\"09:05\"` 라는 글자를 시각 값으로 바꾼 뒤, 시(hour)만 꺼내 출력하시오.\n","\n","| | |\n","|---|---|\n","| 주어지는 값 | `time_text = \"09:05\"` |\n","| 🎯 나와야 하는 결과 | `9` |\n","\n","<details>\n","<summary>▸ 힌트 보기</summary>\n","\n","1. `datetime.strptime(time_text, \"%H:%M\")`으로 시각 값으로 바꿔 이름에 담습니다.\n","2. 담은 값 뒤에 `.hour`를 붙이면 시만 나옵니다.\n","3. `09:05`가 그대로 나오면 `.hour`를 빠뜨린 것입니다.\n","\n","그래도 막히면 맨 아래 정답 7-3 셀의 「코드 표시」를 누릅니다.\n","\n","</details>"],"id":"TUASwUtevuAy"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":51,"metadata":{"id":"iyCfkWDUvuAy","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1790552714797,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":9,"user":{"displayName":"박성근","userId":"14853956948590111399"}},"outputId":"cac0bd1c-8e66-469a-dcde-fcc158a8ea33"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["9\n"]}],"source":["from datetime import datetime\n","time_text = \"09:05\"\n","log_time = datetime.strptime(time_text, \"%H:%M\")\n","\n","print(log_time.hour)\n"],"id":"iyCfkWDUvuAy"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"ksh5Rn9hvuAz"},"source":["로그 목록에 쓰면 이렇게 됩니다. 반복문 안에서 한 건씩 바꿉니다."],"id":"ksh5Rn9hvuAz"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":52,"metadata":{"id":"4MRrz9MRvuAz","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1790552716806,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":18,"user":{"displayName":"박성근","userId":"14853956948590111399"}},"outputId":"064bf926-bc67-439e-bc4c-5c093cce14d1"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["03:11 → 3 시\n","09:01 → 9 시\n"]}],"source":["from datetime import datetime\n","\n","logs = [{\"time\": \"03:11\"}, {\"time\": \"09:01\"}]\n","\n","for log in logs:\n","    log_time = datetime.strptime(log[\"time\"], \"%H:%M\")  # 글자를 시각 값으로\n","    print(log[\"time\"], \"→\", log_time.hour, \"시\")"],"id":"4MRrz9MRvuAz"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7bZbHVczvuAz"},"source":["<table width=